  "question": {
    "text": "If in the expansion of $(1+x)^{\\mathrm{p}}(1-x)^{\\mathrm{q}}$, the coefficients of $x$ and $x^2$ are 1 and -2 , respectively, then $\\mathrm{p}^2+\\mathrm{q}^2$ is equal to :"
